        "summary": "EvidenceReachability classifies every recorded evidence token in exactly two git spawns per invocation regardless of commit or spec count: one cat-file --batch-check over stdin, one streamed rev-list HEAD abandoned once every candidate is seen. Reachable commits silent; present-but-orphaned a warning stating the recorded value is left as-is; tokens that are not commits here (UUIDs, foreign SHAs) ignored by contract and never probed as refs. Every git failure degrades to ignored - validate never crashes and never rewrites a SHA.",
